!data/processed/ecoli_validation_combined.json
!data/processed/ecoli_validation_per_site.csv
!data/processed/validation_sites.csv
!data/processed/prf_comparison.json
!data/processed/sampling_plan_test.json
# Live scores withdrawn when the coverage rule changed, kept because README and the Method page cite them.
!data/processed/verification_live_oldrule_2026-09-28.json
# Scottish covariates (Scotland plan S2). Contains Scottish Water data licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
!data/processed/sw_covariates.parquet
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/bathing_waters_inland.json
!data/raw/bathing_water_classifications.json
!data/raw/osm_swim_candidates.csv
!data/raw/wales_bathing_waters.json
!data/raw/coastal_catalogue.json
!data/raw/coastal_wqa_points.json
!data/raw/places.json
# The rivers and lakes the home page's search finds on the map (scripts/make_waters.py).
!data/raw/waters.json
!data/raw/outside_england.json
# Checked joins of outfalls on streams OS Open Rivers does not draw (overflows.apply_joins).
!data/raw/overflow_joins.csv
# Fixes to the river network that the load-time rules do not make (dipcast.network.fixes).
!data/raw/network_fixes.csv
# Residence times of WFD lakes from HydroLAKES v1.0 (CC BY 4.0), for lake path 'residence' (scripts/make_lake_residence.py).
!data/raw/lake_residence.csv
# The same at spill-time flow (EA Hydrology daily mean flows, OGL v3.0), for lake path 'residence_spill' (scripts/make_lake_spill_ratio.py).
!data/raw/lake_residence_spill.csv
# Reasons for not achieving good status per water body, and each spot's water body (EA Catchment Data Explorer, OGL v3.0; scripts/make_rnags.py).
!data/raw/rnags.json
